{"id":"n62556-2-7","stage":4,"title":"설교 · 教诲","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62556-2-7-1","ko":"너는 인생을 그렇게 살면 안 돼.","zh":"你不能那样过日子的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인생을","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살면","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f5266ca313518a9f","term":"인생","zh":"人生","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3","entryId":"62449","definition":"人在世上生活的事。","pronunciation":["인생"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c1babf630572b39fc95.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62556-2-7-2","ko":"나한테 설교를 늘어놓을 생각이라면 그만둬.","zh":"如果你是想来对我说教的话，那就别说了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설교를","meaning":"教诲","explanation":"설교：教诲；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설교","audio":"/audio/c744b2ccab0327021c65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62556","senseId":"2","lemma":"설교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘어놓을","meaning":"没完没了，啰嗦","explanation":"늘어놓다：没完没了，啰嗦；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"늘어놓다","audio":"/audio/3a491267fe7652159654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37864","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘어놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이라면","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면：假定某情况成立：“如果、假如……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만둬.","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c744b2ccab032702","term":"설교","zh":"教诲","audio":"/audio/c744b2ccab0327021c65.mp3","entryId":"62556","definition":"劝导并教育他人；或指那样的教导。","pronunciation":["설교"]},{"id":"3a491267fe765215","term":"늘어놓다","zh":"没完没了，啰嗦","audio":"/audio/3a491267fe7652159654.mp3","entryId":"37864","definition":"将不重要的话语或文章等说得或写得很长。","pronunciation":["느러노타"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea093741b7010df721d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.093,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62556","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["如果你是想来对我说教的话，那就别说了。","怎么这样拽我的衣服，都要扯变形了？","你不能那样过日子的。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["如果你是想来对我说教的话，那就别说了。","你不能那样过日子的。","怎么这样拽我的衣服，都要扯变形了？"],"answer":0}]}
